# `node_modules/` and `.next/` are already ignored by the repository root .gitignore. The npm
# cache is NOT here at all: `tools/node.sh` keeps it under `$XDG_CACHE_HOME/wenext/`, outside the
# repository, because every image in this stack builds with `context: .` and would otherwise ship
# a few hundred megabytes of cache it has no use for.

# Generated by `next build` / `next dev`, regenerated on every build — same as create-next-app.
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo
